    "preamble": "Lakshmi Mistanna Bhander & Ors vs The State Of West Bengal on 6 July, 2017 1 06/07/2017 Ardr Crr 2463 of 2014 Lakshmi Mistanna Bhander & ors. Vs. The State of West Bengal Mr. Pratip Kumar Chatterjee, ...for the petitioners.",
    "facts": "According to him, the learned trial Court as well as the learned first Appellate Court could not appreciate the evidence in its proper perspectives. He added that the seizure witnesses have not been examined and that the report of the Public Analyst has not been exhibited properly. It appears from the order of the learned trial Court that he has recorded evidence, and after a threadbare discussion, has passed the order of conviction against the present petitioner. Challenging the said finding, the present petitioner has approached before the first Appellate Court.",
